{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rustls/rustls/releases/411805088","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rustls/rustls/releases/411805088/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/rustls/rustls/releases/411805088/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/rustls/rustls/releases/tag/v/0.23.46","id":411805088,"author":{"login":"ctz","id":579363,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTM2Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/579363?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz","html_url":"https://github.com/ctz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOA3PM4M4Yi6Wg","tag_name":"v/0.23.46","target_commitish":"rel-0.23","name":"0.23.46","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-13T11:15:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T09:51:22Z","published_at":"2026-10-14T09:51:22Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rustls/rustls/tarball/v/0.23.46","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rustls/rustls/zipball/v/0.23.46","body":"## Security-relevant fixes:\r\n\r\n* **[GHSA-h2v8-394m-p7vv](https://github.com/rustls/rustls/security/advisories/GHSA-h2v8-394m-p7vv)**: The built-in (but disabled by default) Brotli certificate decompression can allocate an attacker-controlled amount of memory up to 1 GiB before authentication *\r\n\r\n* **[GHSA-c8m5-c952-6cm4](https://github.com/rustls/rustls/security/advisories/GHSA-c8m5-c952-6cm4)**: `Debug` impls for `Tls12ClientSessionValue` and `Tls13ClientSessionValue` include secret data *\r\n\r\n* **[GHSA-w44r-93j7-qv28](https://github.com/rustls/rustls/security/advisories/GHSA-w44r-93j7-qv28)**: An unauthenticated ServerHello poisons the per-name key-exchange hints, so later ClientHellos carry only a classical X25519 share. Thank you to @Adam010341 .\r\n\r\n* **[GHSA-vp88-798v-h67f](https://github.com/rustls/rustls/security/advisories/GHSA-vp88-798v-h67f)**: In rustls 0.23.44 and 0.23.45, application data that a client buffers before the handshake completes is sent to the server even when the server rejects Encrypted Client Hello (ECH). Thank you to @ramonmrc18.\r\n\r\n## Other fixes taken from main:\r\n\r\n- server: reject non-empty certificate_request_context in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3294 **\r\n- reject protected change_cipher_spec records in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3295 **\r\n- brotli: reject large-window streams in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3297 *\r\n- Avoiding printing secrets in session types in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3299 *\r\n- client: fail on ECH rejection before encrypting application data in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3300 *\r\n- server: only allow early data for first PSK in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3312 *\r\n- compress: reject trailing input in zlib and brotli decompressors in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3318 **\r\n- ech: hold the server to its hello retry request decision in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3325 **\r\n- conn: be more careful about confidentiality limits with 1.2 in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3332 *\r\n- Fixes related to I/O issues in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3333 *\r\n- Advance the HPKE sequence only after open succeeds in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3340 *\r\n- Timely 1.3 key updates in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3342 *\r\n\r\n\\* Thanks to OpenAI <OutboundDisclosures@openai.com> for submitting 13 findings to us, whose fixes are included in this release.\r\n\\** Thanks to @Mounika2456 for their continued contribution of hardening and compliance fixes\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* [0.23] bogo: avoid flicker on error handling with an alert by @ctz in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3339\r\n* [0.23] Retain up to the requested LimitedCache capacity by @6d7770 in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3337\r\n* Prepare 0.23.46 by @djc in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3354\r\n* [0.23] Delay saving KX hint until handshake confirmation by @ctz in https://github.com/rustls/rustls/pull/3355\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/rustls/rustls/compare/v/0.23.45...v/0.23.46","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rustls/rustls/releases/411805088/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":6}